---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Micro Signal Cosmos"
  description="Privacy Policy for Micro Signal Cosmos. Read our transparent policies on data handling, cookies, analytics, and reader privacy protection."
  canonical="https://microsignalcosmos.com/privacy-policy/"
>
  <Header />

  <main id="main-content" class="bg-[#0B0F19] py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="container-main">

      <!-- Header Section -->
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
        <div class="mb-6 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-sky-400/20 bg-sky-400/5 px-4 py-2">
          <span class="h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#00D2FF]"></span>
          <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-sky-300 uppercase">
            Legal Transparency
          </span>
        </div>

        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">
          Privacy <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-400 via-blue-400 to-purple-400 bg-clip-text text-transparent">Policy</span>
        </h1>

        <p class="mt-4 text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-widest">
          Effective Date: November 2026 &bull; Last Revised: November 2026
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Content Article -->
      <article class="mx-auto mt-14 max-w-3xl rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-[#151C2E] p-8 sm:p-12 text-sm leading-8 text-slate-300 space-y-8">

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">1. Introduction</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
            Welcome to <strong class="text-white">Micro Signal Cosmos</strong> ("we," "our," or "us"). We are committed to safeguarding the privacy and digital rights of our readers and visitors. This Privacy Policy outlines the types of information we may collect when you visit our publication, how we use and protect that information, and the choices available to you.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">2. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
            We operate on a principle of data minimization, collecting only information necessary to deliver an informative, reliable, and secure reading experience:
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-slate-400">
            <li>
              <strong class="text-white">Log & Device Data:</strong> Like most online publishers, our web servers and hosting providers automatically log standard request data, including internet protocol (IP) addresses, browser type, operating system, referring/exit pages, and access timestamps for diagnostic and security auditing purposes.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-white">Voluntary Communications:</strong> When you contact our editorial team via email or our contact form, we collect the personal information you choose to provide (such as your name, email address, and message contents) solely to respond to your inquiry.
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-white">Newsletter Subscriptions:</strong> If you opt in to our future newsletter, we will collect your email address solely to deliver requested editorial dispatches. You may unsubscribe at any time.
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">3. Cookies & Local Storage</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
            Micro Signal Cosmos does not use invasive surveillance cookies or cross-site tracking beacons. We may use essential, lightweight cookies or browser local storage strictly for operational needs (such as remembering display preferences or managing session state). You can configure your browser to reject cookies, though some interactive elements may function with reduced capabilities.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">4. How We Use Information</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
            Any telemetry or correspondence collected is used exclusively for:
          </p>
          <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 text-slate-400">
            <li>Ensuring technical stability, uptime, and fast page delivery.</li>
            <li>Detecting, preventing, and mitigating security threats or abusive traffic.</li>
            <li>Responding to editorial feedback, corrections, and reader inquiries.</li>
            <li>Analyzing aggregated, non-personally identifiable site traffic patterns to improve content curation.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
            <strong class="text-white">We do not sell, rent, or trade reader personal information to third-party data brokers or marketing networks.</strong>
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">5. Third-Party Integrations & External Links</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
            Our articles and footer contain links to third-party platforms (e.g., YouTube, Facebook, scientific research repositories, and reference documents). When you navigate to external destinations, their respective privacy practices govern your data. We encourage you to review their independent privacy policies.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">6. Your Rights & Data Choices</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
            Depending on your geographic location (including regions governed by the GDPR or CCPA/CPRA), you may hold statutory rights regarding your personal data, including the right to request access to, rectification of, or deletion of any correspondence we maintain. To exercise any data rights, please contact our privacy desk.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">7. Policy Updates</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
            We may revise this Privacy Policy periodically to reflect technological adjustments, legal compliance, or architectural evolutions. Any modifications will be posted to this URL with an updated revision date.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="border-t border-white/10 pt-8">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">8. Contact Information</h2>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400">
            For questions, concerns, or requests regarding this Privacy Policy, please contact our editorial and data administration team:
          </p>
          <div class="mt-4 rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-[#0B0F19] p-5 text-xs text-slate-400 space-y-1">
            <p><strong class="text-white">Publication:</strong> Micro Signal Cosmos (Independent Digital Publication)</p>
            <p><strong class="text-white">Privacy Desk:</strong> privacy@microsignalcosmos.com</p>
            <p><strong class="text-white">Operations:</strong> Digital-first editorial network</p>
            <p><strong class="text-white">Reader Communications:</strong> Available through our official <a href="/contact/" class="text-sky-400 underline hover:text-sky-300">Contact Desk</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </article>

    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

